1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

FCF is a novel language processing architecture that replaces traditional
neural network layers with a constraint-driven pattern memory system. Instead
of learning weights through backpropagation, the system:

  • Stores successful patterns in a multi-tiered memory
  • Retrieves relevant patterns via token-indexed search
  • Composes new outputs by combining low-friction patterns
  • Learns through pattern persistence (not gradient descent)

CORE PRINCIPLE:
  "What persists is what stays affordable under repetition."

  High-friction patterns fade.
  Low-friction patterns persist.
  Alignment emerges from affordability.


