2.2 DATA FLOW
─────────────

INPUT (prompt) 
  → Embedding (768-dim vector)
  → Memory Search (token-indexed retrieval)
  → Pattern Selection (top-k by score + friction)
  → Token Boosting (increase logits for memory tokens)
  → Generation (sample from modified distribution)
  → Evaluation (score by constraints + reality)
  → Storage (if low-friction, persist to memory)
  → OUTPUT (generated text)


