10. VALIDATION & TESTING
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

10.1 UNIT TESTS
───────────────

Memory System:
  ✓ Store and retrieve pattern
  ✓ LRU ordering maintained
  ✓ Token indexing correct
  ✓ Tier transitions (HOT→WARM→COLD)
  ✓ Pruning triggers correctly
  ✓ Encryption/decryption

Generation:
  ✓ Memory search returns relevant patterns
  ✓ Token boosting affects logits
  ✓ Output is coherent text
  ✓ Scores calculated correctly

Constraints:
  ✓ Friction calculated per layer
  ✓ Force detection triggers
  ✓ Alignment score in [0, 1]

10.2 INTEGRATION TESTS
──────────────────────

End-to-end:
  ✓ Generate → Score → Store → Retrieve → Generate
  ✓ Memory persists across restarts
  ✓ Gel state transitions work
  ✓ Performance targets met

10.3 VALIDATION METRICS
───────────────────────

Quality:
  • Perplexity on test set
  • BLEU/ROUGE scores
  • Human evaluation (coherence, relevance)

System:
  • Memory utilization
  • Retrieval accuracy
  • Pattern persistence rate
  • Friction distribution

Efficiency:
  • Tokens/second
  • Memory footprint
  • Search latency


